%description:
Header compression (ROHC) applies to IP sessions only: a bearer definition stating rohc
is an error when the base station installs it for a UE of an Unstructured PDU session
(here an on-demand bearer, installed when the UE's first payload arrives).

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
network = simu5g.test.moduletest.lib.NrSessionTestNetwork

*.ue[*].sessionType = "Unstructured"
*.ue[*].hasIpv4 = false
*.ue[*].numUnstructuredApps = 1
*.ue[*].unstructuredApp[0].source.packetLength = 100B
*.ue[*].unstructuredApp[0].source.productionInterval = 20ms
*.ue[*].unstructuredApp[0].source.initialProductionOffset = 0.1s
*.upf.nodeControl.unstructuredPrefix = "10.99.0.0/16"
*.upf.nodeControl.unstructuredServer = "server"
*.upf.nodeControl.unstructuredServerPort = 5000
*.upf.nodeControl.unstructuredPort = 5001
*.bearerConfigurator.onDemandDrbs = [{coreNetwork: "5gc", isDefault: true, suppressSdapHeader: true, lcg: 3, rlcMode: "UM", rohc: true}]

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%exitcode: 1
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stderr
ConnectionControlEnb: the definition of DRB 1 of NrSessionTestNetwork.ue[0] states "rohc", but the UE's session is of type "Unstructured" -- header compression (ROHC) applies to IP sessions only
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
